ke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><line id="booking_edge10" x1="1816" y1="1584" x2="1944" y2="1584" data-start="booking_paid" data-end="booking_bus" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><line id="booking_edge11" x1="2432" y1="1584" x2="2560" y2="1584" data-start="booking_bus" data-end="booking_handoff" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><textArea id="booking_text0" x="64" y="1856" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Read 1–5 left to right, then 6–10, then 11–15. Each row is a separate stage of the same booking lifecycle.</textArea><textArea id="booking_text1" x="64" y="1952" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Integrity: invalid or ambiguous payment remains pending for reconciliation; browser success never authorizes dispatch.</textArea><textArea id="booking_text2" x="64" y="2048" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Expiry: late captured payment requires a fresh stock check or compensating refund. Review stock owner and serviceability.</textArea></g></svg>